<title>UK: AB Ports signs 10 year Plymouth ferry deal.</title>
<headline>AB Ports signs 10 year Plymouth ferry deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated British Ports Holdings Plc said Tuesday it has signed a new 10 year agreement with Brittany Ferries for the French operator to continue operating from its port of Plymouth.</p>
<p>ABP provides two berths, a passenger terminal and cargo handling facilities at the Millbay Docks in Plymouth. Brittany Ferries began operating from Plymouth to Roscoff in France in 1973 and added services to Santander in Spain in 1978.</p>
</text>
